Please reboot again (or tell me to run `rootshell reboot`). After it is back I only need one non-sync `eglrun.sh` run with the hook (PC2_MAX=1) for the final captured log, then I commit docs/reports/gpu31-polycensus2.md. I will not use trace/sync or the experiment knobs again.

